tegories\" value=\"Magic: The Gathering\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Magic: The Gathering</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"One Piece TCG\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>One Piece TCG</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Dragon Ball Super\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Dragon Ball Super</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Sports Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Sports Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Vintage / Retro Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Vintage / Retro Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Card Accessories &amp; Supplies\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Card Accessories &amp; Supplies</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Graded Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Graded Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Other Collectibles\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Other Collectibles</label></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">About Your Business *</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"description\">Tell us about your products, experience, and what you&#x27;d bring to the event.</label><textarea id=\"description\" name=\"description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"We specialize in graded vintage Pokémon cards and sealed booster boxes. We&#x27;ve been selling at collector events for 3 years...\" required=\"\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Social Media &amp; Online Presence</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-grid\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"social_links\">Instagram / Social Links *</label><input id=\"social_links\" type=\"url\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"https://instagram.com/yourbusiness\" name=\"social_links\" value=\"\"/><span class=\"vendor-form-hint\">Share your Instagram, Facebook, or other social profiles.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Event Requirements</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-grid\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"tables_requested\">Number of Tables Requested *</label><select id=\"tables_requested\" name=\"tables_requested\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select quantity</option><option value=\"1\">1 Table</option><option value=\"2\">2 Tables</option><option value=\"3\">3 Tables</option><option value=\"4\">4 Tables</option><option value=\"5+\">5+ Tables (contact for large setup)</option></select></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"power_requirements\">Power Requirements</label><select id=\"power_requirements\" name=\"power_requirements\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select requirement</option><option value=\"none\">No power needed</option><option value=\"standard\">Standard outlet (1-2 devices)</option><option value=\"multiple\">Multiple outlets (3+ devices)</option><option value=\"heavy\">Heavy duty (equipment requiring dedicated circuit)</option></select><span class=\"vendor-form-hint\">Let us know your electrical needs for the event.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Additional Notes</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"additional_notes\">Anything else we should know?</label><textarea id=\"additional_notes\" name=\"additional_notes\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Special setup requirements, accessibility needs, or other information...\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label class=\"vendor-agreement-label\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.75rem;cursor:pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required=\"\" style=\"margin-top:0.25rem;accent-color:var(--color-dark)\" name=\"agreement\"/><span style=\"font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.5\">I agree to the <a href=\"/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:var(--color-dark)\">Terms and Conditions</a> and confirm that all information provided is accurate. I understand that submission of this application does not guarantee vendor acceptance. *</span></label></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-yellow vendor-submit-btn\">Submit Application</button><p class=\"vendor-form-disclaimer\">By submitting this form, you agree to be contacted regarding vendor opportunities at Collector&#x27;s Paradise events. All applications are reviewed by our team.</p></form></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0vw2ofiizeta4.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[47420,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0g6h.9ak5x__~.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/10xs-qv9j8y.-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0g6h.9ak5x__~.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/10xs-qv9j8y.-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0g6h.9ak5x__~.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/10xs-qv9j8y.-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[62319,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0g6h.9ak5x__~.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/10xs-qv9j8y.-.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/000cse85_u.m1